<title>MEXICO: Apasco expects export one mln tonnes in '97.</title>
<headline>Apasco expects export one mln tonnes in '97.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican cement company Apasco said on Friday it expects to export one million tonnes of cement this year.</p>
<p>&quot;For 1997 we expect export volume of approximately one million tonnes,&quot; company finances and administrative director Carlos Buhler told reporters.</p>
<p>In the first six months of the year the company exported 586,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>He said the company was working at 80 to 85 percent of installed capacity. Exports will be less than last year because of a recovery in domestic cement demand, Buhler added.</p>
<p>((--Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9562))</p>
